WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.150
Good news first: this adventure helps you get more from every token.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.030
It never asks you to use less AI.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.350
But AI reads more than you type.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.950
With every message, it rereads the whole chat.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.870
It all counts in tokens, small pieces of text.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:24.330
So when you ask for everything in your Slack, it reads every message it can reach.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.610
For one small question.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.350
It's like running the washing machine for one shirt.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.770
Still, ask for one channel and the last two weeks, and it reads what your question needs.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:43.530
And a strong model that finishes in one or two rounds can cost less than a lighter one that needs many.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:51.370
So in this adventure, you test and refine some of your habits, and learn where your tokens are a good use of your time and money,

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.310
and where they just spin.
